# Accepted in the pull request gate of .github/workflows/images.yaml and by the CVE watch (they still show in scans and
# on Artifact Hub).
#
# github.com/mojocn/base64Captcha v0.0.0-20190801020520-752b1cd608b2: the fixed versions (1.3.6 and later) no longer
# have the API that Cloudreve 4.19.1 calls (ConfigCharacter, GenerateCaptcha, VerifyCaptcha,
# CaptchaWriteToBase64Encoding), so the module cannot move without changing Cloudreve. The vulnerable function,
# memoryStore.Verify of 1.x, accepts an empty answer for an unknown captcha id; the 2019 version has no such
# function, and the VerifyCaptcha that Cloudreve calls refuses an empty answer before it reads the store.
CVE-2023-45292
